ation messages based on detected locale\n- Pass locale and messages as props to Header component\n- Add fallback to English messages if locale loading fails\n- Maintain proper language switching functionality\n\nCart Functionality Fixes:\n- Fix CartItem props interface mismatch in CartClient\n- Correct item.id references to item.product.id throughout cart\n- Add comprehensive null checks in imageUtils functions\n- Fix updateQuantity action parameter consistency\n- Remove invalid className prop from ProductCardSkeleton","tree":{"sha":"62323247824cb15286c675b8ffc4a7bb6bfe6292","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erolkuluslu/next-auth/git/trees/62323247824cb15286c675b8ffc4a7bb6bfe6292"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erolkuluslu/next-auth/git/commits/2426f658ae24a462f79653656fff884ab0289eb3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92374052?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erolkuluslu","id":92374052,"login":"erolkuluslu","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGEJA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erolkuluslu/next-auth/commit/2426f658ae24a462f79653656fff884ab0289eb3","node_id":"C_