","id":92374052,"login":"erolkuluslu","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGEJA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erolkuluslu/next-auth/commits/df9aff5a3e7e3806841810b5d8e5e686f9a330a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-20T19:30:03Z","email":"erolkuluslu@hotmail.com","name":"erolkuluslu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-20T19:30:03Z","email":"erolkuluslu@hotmail.com","name":"erolkuluslu"},"message":"feat: Build comprehensive UI component system with accessibility-first design\n\n### Phase 5a Implementation: Core UI Components\n\n#### Component Architecture\n- **CVA Integration**: Class Variance Authority for consistent variants\n- **TypeScript**: Strict typing with proper prop interfaces\n- **Accessibility**: WCAG 2.1 AA compliance throughout\n- **Responsive**: Mobile-first design with Tailwind CSS\n\n#### Core Components Built\n- **Button**: Multiple variants, sizes, loading states, icon support\n- **Card**: Modular design with Header, Content, Footer sections\n- **Input**: Error states, icon support, label integration\n- **Select**: Options array with validation and accessibility\n- **Badge**: Flexible variants for labels and counts\n- **Container**: Responsive max-widths and padding variants\n- **Modal**: Portal-based with focus trap and escape handling\n- **ProductCard**: E-commerce optimized with ratings and pricing\n- **Skeleton**: Loading states for smooth UX transitions\n\n#### Technical Features\n- **Type Safety**: Complete TypeScript interfaces\n- **Performance**: Optimized re-renders with React.forwardRef\n- **Maintainability**: Consistent patterns and clear APIs\n\n#### Acceptance Criteria Met ✅\n- ✅ Reusable component library with consistent design\n- ✅ Accessibility compliance (WCAG 2.1 AA)\n- ✅ Responsive design across all screen sizes\n- ✅ TypeScript strict mode compatibility","tree":{"sha":"2b7a7d27ec9a31dc5cbb8eb3861757bbf956e04d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erolkuluslu/next-auth/git/trees/2b7a7d27ec9a31dc5cbb8eb3861757bbf956e04d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erolkuluslu/next-auth/git/commits/df9aff5a3e7e3806841810b5d8e5e686f9a330a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92374052?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erolkuluslu","id":92374052,"login":"erolkuluslu","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGEJA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erolkuluslu/next-auth/commit/df9aff5a3e7e3806841810b5d8e5e686f9a330a2","node_id":"C_kwDOPggHStoAKGRmOWFmZjVhM2U3ZTM4MDY4NDE4MTBiNWQ4ZTVlNjg2ZjlhMzMwYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erolkuluslu/next-auth/commit/76ec9a777ee31083287421d2dc905a635d15b81e","sha":"76ec9a777ee31083287421d2dc905a635d15b81e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erolkuluslu/next-auth/commits/76ec9a777ee31083287421d2dc905a635d15b81e"}],"sha":"df9aff5a3e7e3806841810b5d8e5e686f9a330a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erolkuluslu/next-auth/commits/df9aff5a3e7e3806841810b5d8e5e686f9a330a2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92374052?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erolkuluslu","id":92374052,"login":"erolkuluslu","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGEJA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erolkuluslu/next-auth/commits/76ec9a777ee31083287421d2dc905a635d15b81e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-20T19:29:54Z","email":"erolkuluslu@hotmail.com","name":"erolkuluslu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-20T19:29:54Z","email":"erolkuluslu@hotmail.com","name":"erolkuluslu"},"message":"feat: Implement comprehensive data layer with Fake Store API integration\n\n### Phase 4 Implementation: Data Layer & Caching\n\n#### Product Type System\n- **Zod Validation**: Runtime type checking for API responses\n- **Complete Schemas**: Product, Category, and array validation\n- **Error Handling**: Custom ApiError class with detailed contexts\n\n#### API Layer Features\n- **ISR Caching**: 1-hour revalidation for products, 2-hour for categories\n- **Cache Tags**: Manual invalidation (''products'', ''categories'', ''fakestore'')\n- **Exponential Backoff**: Automatic retry with intelligent delays\n- **Production Fallbacks**: Empty arrays instead of errors\n\n#### Performance Features\n- **Request Optimization**: Parallel requests and intelligent batching\n- **Client-side Utils**: Sorting, filtering, searching utilities\n- **Cache Invalidation**: Manual revalidation utilities\n\n#### Acceptance Criteria Met ✅\n- ✅ Fake Store API fully integrated with error handling\n- ✅ ISR implemented with 1-hour revalidation\n- ✅ Type-safe API responses with Zod validation\n- ✅ Production-ready fallback mechanisms","tree":{"sha":"0e2d2fe4fe4c07125342534898495cbb0aa83f00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erolkuluslu/next-auth/git/trees/0e2d2fe4fe4c07125342534898495cbb0aa83f00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erolkuluslu/next-auth/git/commits/76ec9a777ee31083287421d2dc905a635d15b81e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92374052?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erolkuluslu","id":92374052,"login":"erolkuluslu","node_id":"U_kgDOBYGEJA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erolkuluslu/