epos/ayush-yadavv/adobe-hack-2025/commits/f82bc155a82ee53aea08fb7d839bb6ce0120a222"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115359450?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ayush-yadavv","id":115359450,"login":"ayush-yadavv","node_id":"U_kgDOBuA-2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ayush-yadavv/adobe-hack-2025/commits/6283823c1543f15e7c16e751e313d51243d692d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-20T14:35:31Z","email":"yadav.ayushx1@gmail.com","name":"ayush"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-20T14:35:31Z","email":"yadav.ayushx1@gmail.com","name":"ayush"},"message":"feat(storage): Enhance file saving and URL generation with robust error handling\n\nThis commit introduces significant improvements to the StorageService, focusing on enhanced reliability and error handling during file saving and URL generation.\n\n- **Improved file saving:** Added comprehensive logging at each step of the file saving process, including verification that the file was successfully written and is not empty. This helps in debugging and ensures data integrity.\n- **Robust error handling for file saving:** Wrapped the file saving logic in a try-except block to catch and log any exceptions during the process, re-raising them to the caller for proper handling.\n- **Ensured file closure:** Modified the `finally` block to robustly close the uploaded file''s stream, preventing resource leaks even if an error occurs.\n- **Enhanced URL generation:** Implemented more resilient logic for generating file URLs, including normalizing path separators and handling edge cases for base URLs and relative paths to prevent malformed URLs.\n- **Added error handling for URL generation:** Incorporated a try-except block to catch and log errors during URL generation, improving the stability of link creation.\n\nThese changes make the storage service more resilient, easier to debug, and more reliable in production environments.","tree":{"sha":"f7f7bdca1583c651b9f1f4328fc1032e53398813","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ayush-yadavv/adobe-hack-2025/git/trees/f7f7bdca1583c651b9f1f4328fc1032e53398813"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ayush-yadavv/adobe-hack-2025/git/commits/6283823c1543f15e7c16e751e313d51243d692d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115359450?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ayush-yadavv","id":115359450,"login":"ayush-yadavv","node_id":"U_kgDOBuA-2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_u