name":"ayush"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-19T12:32:57Z","email":"yadav.ayushx1@gmail.com","name":"ayush"},"message":"fix: Standardize .env and storage path resolution\n\nCorrects path resolution for the `.env` file and the static `storage` directory.\n\nThe `.env` file is now consistently loaded from the `backend` directory, resolving issues where environment variables might not have been picked up correctly. The `storage` directory path is also dynamically resolved to `backend/storage`, ensuring static assets are served reliably.\n\nUpdates include:\n- `README.md`: Instructions for `.env` file location updated.\n- `backend/app/core/config.py`: Corrected `PROJECT_ROOT` calculation.\n- `backend/app/main.py`: Adjusted `.env` and `storage` path resolution.\n- `docker-compose.yml`: Added explicit `.env` file loading from `backend/` for the service.\n\nThis ensures consistent environment variable loading and static file serving across development and deployment environments.","tree":{"sha":"6554d3750a48d02626e2e115db95cef78576e293","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ayush-yadavv/adobe-hack-2025/git/trees/6554d3750a48d02626e2e115db95cef78576e293"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ayush-yadavv/adobe-hack-2025/git/commits/cbe0b0d1c1045fe821d987e64a9fb1892cbe7170","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115359450?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ayush-yadavv","id":115359450,"login":"ayush-yadavv","node_id":"U_kgDOBuA-2g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayush-yadavv/orgs","received_events_ur