t_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T08:39:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(generic-ui): keep the route namespace for Create when -all- is selected (#632)\n\n* fix(generic-ui): keep the route namespace for Create when -all- is selected\n\nOn a namespace route with the namespace selection at -all-, the list\nview''s Create flow resolved no namespace. Option queries that declare\n$namespace: String! were sent without it and the dialog did not open.\n\nCreate now falls back to the route''s namespaceId path param, as the\ndetail view does since #617. A concrete selection still wins, and the\nlist itself still follows the selection. When no namespace resolves at\nall, option queries that require $namespace are skipped.\n\nRefs apeirora/showroom#468\n\nSigned-off-by: Theodor Ganescu <star.sg1@gmail.com>\n\n* refactor(generic-ui): pass values to withRouteNamespace\n\nThe helper took ResourceService and LuigiClient only to read the\nresolved namespace and the route''s path params. Callers now pass\nthose values, so the helper no longer depends on either.\n\nRefs apeirora/showroom#468\n\nSigned-off-by: Theodor Ganescu <star.sg1@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Theodor Ganescu <star.sg1@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"f07c2c39b4d5242f0a1fa8d83cd3d91eef45b2fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/portal-ui-lib/git/trees/f07c2c39b4d5242f0a1fa8d83cd3d91eef45b2fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/portal-ui-lib/git/commits/91c6986b5a01c263c8e763b338ece6b9c5bcbbf6","verification":{"payload":"tree f07c2c39b4d5242f0a1fa8d83cd3d91eef45b2fa\nparent caf14c781e9a774df1efeb6b068794734691c7f9\nauthor Theodor Ganescu <anastazya@users.noreply.github.com> 1791275964 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791275964 +0000\n\nfix(generic-ui): keep the route namespace for Create when -all- is selected (#632)\n\n* fix(generic-ui): keep the route namespace for Create when -all- is selected\n\nOn a namespace route with the namespace selection at -all-, the list\nview''s Create flow resolved no namespace. Option queries that declare\n$namespace: String! were sent without it and the dialog did not open.\n\nCreate now falls back to the route''s namespaceId path param, as the\ndetail view does since #617. A concrete selection still wins, and the\nlist itself still follows the selection. When no namespace resolves at\nall, option queries that require $namespace are skipped.\n\nRefs apeirora/showroom#468\n\nSigned-off-by: Theodor Ganescu <star.sg1@gmail.com>\n\n* refactor(generic-ui): pass values to withRouteNamespace\n\nThe helper took ResourceService and LuigiClient only to read the\nresolved namespace and the route''s path params. Callers now pass\nthose values, so the helper no longer depends on either.\n\nRefs apeirora/showroom#468\n\nSigned-off-by: Theodor Ganescu <star.sg1@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Theodor Ganescu <star.sg1@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxLO8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFVQQADmMg8QfAqUK5JgC9CETpwIK\n2WQEKU+fSt42UXtJrlg+voBsbcvUcpCKTpzID82qGBCd7j+gj3R9RtIzRZuAEpFk\nn1w2XUdoEE+4ya+HBz4D/EuzS10HNtI9pFDUP6ijMBkMg6Ez0OLnKlOfYHxrb6EC\nnDbyPwE29oSPY67bd9iEWAbHCJy7utceV+/QMfUEiMJxnumX93itjOhBuDakg/lB\nwhkZyUPH/PDbKN+q7SC/IN3OvrFpZU8dqjRdDuUdNdCVg9Uc8qbxBxjS6giGWuSt\nIK2CXl+qbKvWRAfcDWA0rVbtFCWBsQtdfGlw2rcnjPQm5TVdKRWpycwCE3t66sUc\nmXBhOMjuc1D7+g2Jf3cr8wbqze2QhBh5g2e0gScKQ7qjWcu+UorezuygfgRjN+/G\nyA9AxXgAYbldBkwsgIzOx6h0wsc8tXd/qlf37RnrnjmgfFaDRESGqQ0S6jGIluZw\nqqOkyLMhjw2lkGfUOnC1FAG1v5+IiWXJt0nOG6DmWjEQU+A78YuCZ3ajlcSXEE5/\nQLELbybS2EYBvPQ7r6WLuSr/wTO2SqCMLyPsEx/aKgV6GT0mnEaHFeAxRPH061uE\nuGWVF3tSnphfSIkPd4bLelC9sYdzeZdVG5i2fQXuu+TaNLp/vQ5K0ReQkEOgpf6M\nSQ6WJYYsVVYqfT1DwuCV\n=zYLy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T08:39:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/pri