_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philtk79/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philtk79/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philtk79/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/philtk79","id":253026766,"login":"philtk79","node_id":"U_kgDODxThzg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philtk79/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philtk79/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philtk79/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philtk79/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philtk79/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/philtk79","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/portal-ui-lib/commits/0a24e2871dd23976d0e60a38dbb1b8067f6a2c9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T11:46:24Z","email":"253026766+philtk79@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Till"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T11:46:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(generic-ui): add hint, switch, and write-only field mapping (#610)\n\n* feat(generic-ui): add hint, switch, and write-only field mapping\n\nBump @openmfp/ngx to ^1.3.0 and map uiSettings.writeOnly, hint, and\ndisplayAs switch in toFormFields for list create and edit forms.\n\nSigned-off-by: Till <253026766+philtk79@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor(generic-ui): use top-level form field props from CC\n\nDrop PlatformMeshUiSettings and map inputType, hint, writeOnly, and\nplaceholder directly from PlatformMeshFieldDefinition. Restore\nflattenFieldTree tests and revert the manual version bump.\n\nSigned-off-by: Till <253026766+philtk79@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor(generic-ui): derive form input type from inputType only\n\nDrop the uiSettings.displayAs === ''secret'' fallback in the form field\nmapper. Input type is now driven solely by the top-level inputType from\nContent Configuration, matching the FormFieldDefinition contract.\n\nSigned-off-by: Till <253026766+philtk79@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor(models): drop redundant uiSettings remap in PlatformMeshFieldDefinition\n\nTableFieldDefinition already exposes uiSettings via FieldDefinition, so the\nOmit + re-declared uiSettings (leftover from the removed PlatformMeshUiSettings)\nwere redundant. Reuse TableFieldDefinition''s uiSettings directly and drop the\nnow-unused UiSettings import.\n\nSigned-off-by: Till <253026766+philtk79@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* chore: keep package version at 0.57.0 after rebase onto main\n\nThe feature commits still carried 0.56.2 and overwrote the release\nversion when the branch was rebased onto v0.57.0.\n\nSigned-off-by: Till <253026766+philtk79@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Till <253026766+philtk79@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Andrian Krautsou <117839500+Sobyt483@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3443e27338c0a6b8cfcbe355e02dce3413a9d551","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/portal-ui-lib/git/trees/3443e27338c0a6b8cfcbe355e02dce3413a9d551"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/portal-ui-lib/git/commits/0a24e2871dd23976d0e60a38dbb1b8067f6a2c9b","verification":{"payload":"tree 3443e27338c0a6b8cfcbe355e02dce3413a9d551\nparent 56a5b4d5b7a183f239a8f83dbd7d34cf151e96c8\nauthor Till <253026766+philtk79@users.noreply.github.com> 1789127184 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789127184 +0000\n\nfeat(generic-ui): add hint, switch, and write-only field mapping (#610)\n\n* feat(generic-ui): add hint, switch, and write-only field mapping\n\nBump @openmfp/ngx to ^1.3.0 and map uiSettings.writeOnly, hint, and\ndisplayAs switch in toFormFields for list create and edit forms.\n\nSigned-off-by: Till <253026766+philtk79@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor(generic-ui): use top-level form field props from CC\n\nDrop PlatformMeshUiSettings and map inputType, hint, writeOnly, and\nplaceholder directly from PlatformMeshFieldDefinition. Restore\nflattenFieldTree tests and revert the manual version bump.\n\nSigned-off-by: Till <253026766+philtk79@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor(generic-ui): derive form input type from inputType only\n\nDrop the uiSettings.displayAs === ''secret'' fallback in the form field\nmapper. Input type is now driven solely by the top-level inputType from\nContent Configuration, matching the FormFieldDefinition contract.\n\nSigned-off-by: Till <253026766+philtk79@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor(models): drop redundant uiSettings remap in PlatformMeshFieldDefinition\n\nTableFieldDefinition already exposes uiSettings via FieldDefinition, so the\nOmit + re-declared uiSettings (leftover from the removed PlatformMeshUiSettings)\nwere redundant. Reuse TableFieldDefinition''s uiSettings directly and drop the\nnow-unused UiSettings import.\n\nSigned-off-by: Till <253026766+philtk79@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* chore: keep package version at 0.57.0 after rebase onto main\n\nThe feature commits still carried 0.56.2 and overwrote the release\nversion when the branch was rebased onto v0.57.0.\n\nSigned-off-by: Till <253026766+philtk79@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Till <253026766+philtk79@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Andrian Krautsou <117839500+Sobyt483@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqo+oQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzQ0QAFSCS98E4mWUrLQnVLs0LkQd\nqBLZ9BWb9A0B3NzL+tbwWGn7kSCVtbVynLHO2lFaaJSh13/XPoGhrCd49vMWsgj6\nlc+QEshXS9SK0QaEKQdIS10hFbFu6nTZjQSOKwWqqjwZwxC7la3VJMbA4BeR0a8O\nFLVy9lte1kTgTHOQNvRyNYSd6l9LZyacfTz8d9CzyNO+Rdc+f+E7B35ZcfJTnsNp\nS8kzA5eqra5A42apb+AWm93AEux2FTPunWoNYN80ra6gILZONDIeaG2Xx5IzoSar\nD3SQjM/78aqvYviDasOYhi27EDddW7aq4E1myn7WSoIaJ2ai9DXfZNm6o+CN2R7F\nGbwvPZh0Ob+Kry05MWP3XpoIPAY5f4+9ZihAGJ9ohDjhNXNt5SF2Nkol8oWEWSMc\nE4UyNp9JinRCAktzNr/tL+w