re submitted as literal dotted keys inside each collection entry\n(\"spec.override\": \"v1\") instead of being expanded to a nested object\n({ spec: { override: \"v1\" } }). The @openmfp/ngx form only expands\ntop-level control keys; collection FormArray entries are emitted verbatim.\n\nAdd expandCollectionEntries() in to-form-fields.ts, which walks the field\ndefinitions and rewrites each collection entry''s keys via setPropertyByPath\n(recursing into nested collections), and apply it in ResourceTableCard\nonCreateSubmit before resourceService.create.\n\nFixes #586\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"7210f1fc36b5aeec2bb0df1219e128e69b539904","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/portal-ui-lib/git/trees/7210f1fc36b5aeec2bb0df1219e128e69b539904"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/portal-ui-lib/git/commits/5926f1055ab91de8f7c7cfdf555bdd36e1cdeeb9","verification":{"payload":"tree 7210f1fc36b5aeec2bb0df1219e128e69b539904\nparent a2e4047bfeb30f6f262b2a3a409fb5ab838aa313\nauthor Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com> 1788784052 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788784052 +0200\n\nfix: expand nested propertyCollection sub-field paths on create (#607)\n\nCollection sub-fields whose property contains a dot (e.g. spec.override)\nwere submitted as literal dotted keys inside each collection entry\n(\"spec.override\": \"v1\") instead of being expanded to a nested object\n({ spec: { override: \"v1\" } }). The @openmfp/ngx form only expands\ntop-level control keys; collection FormArray entries are emitted verbatim.\n\nAdd expandCollectionEntries() in to-form-fields.ts, which walks the field\ndefinitions and rewrites each collection entry''s keys via setPropertyByPath\n(recursing into nested collections), and apply it in ResourceTableCard\nonCreateSubmit before resourceService.create.\n\nFixes #586\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nw