","email":"john.andre.hestad@nav.no","name":"John Andre Hestad"},"message":"Legg til vitest og lint av .astro-malene\n\neslint-globen dekket kun ts/tsx, så malene var i praksis ulinta; egen blokk med flat/recommended tar dem med. 18 tester dekker tekstlogikk, språkdekning og to stilregler (gyldige box-shadow-verdier, fokusring som ikke klippes bort). Nye scripts: lint og test - workflowene kobles på i egen endring.","tree":{"sha":"c436d0054a1bf0ecb945ce231bb61d03925b9b4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/tiltakspenger-meldekort-microfrontend/git/trees/c436d0054a1bf0ecb945ce231bb61d03925b9b4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/navikt/tiltakspenger-meldekort-microfrontend/git/commits/475aa46ce0e29f9b3250bec871ccaa12da37f1d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1081740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hestad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hestad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hestad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hestad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hestad","id":1081740,"login":"hestad","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODE3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hestad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hestad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hestad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hestad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hestad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hestad","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/navikt/tiltakspenger-meldekort-microfrontend/commit/475aa46ce0e29f9b3250bec871ccaa12da37f1d4","node_id":"C_kwDOPhHnD9oAKDQ3NWFhNDZjZTBlMjlmOWIzMjUwYmVjODcxY2NhYTEyZGEzN2YxZDQ","parents":[{"html_url