 in\nKAREN_PERSONALITY''s existing Style section so all four user-facing experts (default, very_limited,\nmessages_triage, explore) inherit it without per-skill patches.\n\n* revert SKILL.md \"internally\" rewordings — keep only NEVER guardrail\n\nPer Humberto''s review on PR #359: the karen_prompts.py NEVER rule is\nsufficient; rewording every \"call X\" to \"verify X internally\" was\nover-engineering. Keep the NEVER line in SKILL.md as redundant\nskill-level guardrail; revert the 5 imperative rephrasings.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Art Koval <mail@artemkoval.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"497044a818d5882b77e624e23d60e581c53be015","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smallcloudai/flexus-client-kit/git/trees/497044a818d5882b77e624e23d60e581c53be015"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smallcloudai/flexus-client-kit/git/commits/6918c4bd76f3f1d81522a1364fb973cbba6ae6dc","verification":{"payload":"tree 497044a818d5882b77e624e23d60e581c53be015\nparent d581b879944f28a9ede3af7a5ddfe99db804d084\nauthor Art Koval <mail@deepmasq.ai> 1777385306 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777385306 +0300\n\nfix(2515): stop Karen narrating tool calls in chat replies (#359)\n\n* karen skill: stop narrating support_collection_status to user\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(karen): forbid tool-name narration in user-facing replies (#2515)\n\nKaren''s chat replies were ending with literal lines like \"Status: support_collection_status()\" — the model\npatterning skill instructions (\"call X after each step\") into user-visible narration. Adds one rule in\nKAREN_PERSONALITY''s existing Style section so all four user-facing experts (default, very_limited,\nmessages_triage, explore) inherit it without per-skill patches.\n\n* revert SKILL.md \"internally\" rewordings — keep only NEVER guardrail\n\nPer Humberto''s review on PR #359: the karen_prompts.py NEVER rule is\nsufficient; rewording every \"call X\" to \"verify X internally\" was\nover-engineering. Keep the NEVER line in SKILL.md as redundant\nskill-level guardrail; revert the 5 imperative rephrasings.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Art Koval <mail@artemkoval.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp8L9aCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxuoQAB+uAzR7UaSRMSQoLM11+LHx\nlJTvM+rQsde//xaJoEYM/U9u2xGPMdV1PvIwcuT2ay7NvoLLkjNnJQoU8et1yGvi\n6X/YH/Bq9Qfk5eVNEU7WvZk3uZnw3yhhxE90Mh+E1M+r4bIL0N6q6C11ses5iFVA\nLi9ob7aISbjF6X+Q5nJqVLSezPRh9LqdLrdxh0Oafif/kmyBl9vcv+wRWLivKXgN\n7DQ9Pzkk61MDtLogO3w+LsasXXB60wW8xNDdNxGKJ6oIvZOqpK+dMg6Sy52Rldjq\nV7QWC/eV+psEfv7Dk8xWuM/N5SreTOBZkHZ4ooupdI38yWMh4a667kajMZtRf7hM\n2EzRfXN/OuRknCBlGfYsqDvdLvzgX19v7OVIJJLRD04sIemv7Ytj8dqaDRfqy4DO\nFQAV3OeZNKC+NEnqFURgXETlSrgsy+opJHpRmC1yV0oPekBn4ZNpHoPjccK1LEOA\nVFAGBka2HIUP5D2Zle4G4+lmqxmT+tRwPQCWO+YaEiv26qEw0MPIZDIAdR9WqsNQ\nIJ3Oy4meYsBhS5OtvL+lNPLowE4WySbjwBuc4Fi/LSmWAfYIiofKI/Wf+4X/KILr\nD0L3N3KKC3r7m5vd7mTcXEUnvQeUkHHpzX6iHNcpVuPPg3WsMH4x8+3Ayk2ejvLj\n1mUdl0UACR9rpx1cohiV\n=v49v\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-28T14:08:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/