away.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"09d87cf7db3af000260e2525bc043f247938217c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-instructor-dashboard/git/trees/09d87cf7db3af000260e2525bc043f247938217c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-instructor-dashboard/git/commits/fcc39938443fd0756e1fe753f34e6472189efdbf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/759355?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arbrandes","id":759355,"login":"arbrandes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTM1NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-instructor-dashboard/commit/fcc39938443fd0756e1fe753f34e6472189efdbf","node_id":"C_kwDOPhzKy9oAKGZjYzM5OTM4NDQzZmQwNzU2ZTFmZTc1M2YzNGU2NDcyMTg5ZWZkYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-instructor-dashboard/commit/ee1a9cdefca0aa3cad3d900e9019c36d934dd91e","sha":"ee1a9cdefca0aa3cad3d900e9019c36d934dd91e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-instructor-dashboard/commits/ee1a9cdefca0aa3cad3d900e9019c36d934dd91e"}],"sha":"fcc39938443fd0756e1fe753f34e6472189efdbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-instructor-dashboard/commits/fcc39938443fd0756e1fe753f34e6472189efdbf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/479088?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/blarghmatey","id":479088,"login":"blarghmatey","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3OTA4OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blarghmatey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-instructor-dashboard/commits/ee1a9cdefca0aa3cad3d900e9019c36d934dd91e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T18:09:09Z","email":"tmacey@boundlessnotions.com","name":"Tobias Macey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T18:09:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: surface inactive accounts when adding a course team member (#234)\n\n* fix: surface inactive accounts when adding a course team member\n\nThe team endpoint skips the grant for an inactive user and reports it as\n`error: true, userDoesNotExist: false`. AddTeamMemberModal only inspected\n`userDoesNotExist`, so that result fell through both branches and the modal\nclosed with no alert at all, indistinguishable from a success.\n\nMirrors the bucketing already in enrollments/AddBetaTestersModal. The wording\ndiffers on purpose: enrollments grants the beta role to inactive users and\nwarns about access, while the team endpoint does not grant the role at all.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Rw1RKoF87LSNrD1fFVgfCn\n\n* fix: alert on unexplained failures when adding a course team member\n\nThe handler''s broad `except` reports `error: true` with no reason attached,\nwhich fell through the same way inactive accounts did. Closes the gap rather\nthan leaving it for a follow-up, matching the bucketing openedx#233 is adding\nto EnrollLearnersModal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Rw1RKoF87LSNrD1fFVgfCn\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"76ba2095d8509c8a9a7c69b1f9d820f57f51fb2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-instructor-dashboard/git/trees/76ba2095d8509c8a9a7c69b1f9d820f57f51fb2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-instructor-dashboard/git/commits/ee1a9cdefca0aa3cad3d900e9019c36d934dd91e","verification":{"payload":"tree 76ba2095d8509c8a9a7c69b1f9d820f57f51fb2f\nparent 37e093d319b87edd930b77886d9e03ea3e5a775f\nauthor Tobias Macey <tmacey@boundlessnotions.com> 1790100549 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790100549 -0600\n\nfix: surface inactive accounts when adding a course team member (#234)\n\n* fix: surface inactive accounts when adding a course team member\n\nThe team endpoint skips the grant for an inactive user and reports it as\n`error: true, userDoesNotExist: false`. AddTeamMemberModal only inspected\n`userDoesNotExist`, so that result fell through both branches and the modal\nclosed with no alert at all, indistinguishable from a success.\n\nMirrors the bucketing already in enrollments/AddBetaTestersModal. The wording\ndiffers on purpose: enrollments grants the beta role to inactive users and\nwarns about access, while the team endpoint does not grant the role at all.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Rw1RKoF87LSNrD1fFVgfCn\n\n* fix: alert on unexplained failures when adding a course team member\n\nThe handler''s broad `except` reports `error: true` with no reason attached,\nwhich fell through the same way inactive accounts did. Closes the gap rather\nthan leaving it for a follow-up, matching the bucketing openedx#233 is adding\nto EnrollLearnersModal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Rw1RKoF87LSNrD1fFVgfCn\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqssRFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPT0QABc5vkpg5zlZbhwxyHtsSolc\nwDyGMTH3A2mtAF50GO6v+YbTNWfIWiqIqQ6zQPwe0FaigTsL/V5zwgMGCS0GRZnf\nUD20rrd7CG7PPHpTMcP3qQrEV+UrvAgxhPtZ8meok4OaXibHCTlN4AQiIaNxbOPw\nQc6gNy1WwdY211kQRERtShm2/fDVMyQcJRegQbq0sn9xaUAh+mV165Y5r3zxJOji\n3WjJ8Et07cFjrzJ5VAAwRJ09BIQ+/TPbVBGkWjLtBj5dybJWu7Q4p4nO2lkwKTge\ngdisAfyRNo+45uWH9exftzJo02c6h99Dw5IUvx/jb5B3ZFeVV+66+cWm4gEvRpz8\nnVAG1MNtfljjbSq5JrjbA3soMa/kjRJkUYeeX16WHevKXiqaaNXbqTxvvIhfpakD\nyG745VEVMhflVhzNn26+CUqNQBNezZEs5ftyFfU3yQkBbO68T/ppARFB7PACirLq\nWOT44v/1Qc+2m3uIRWXY517qgPm9iwozrMXt1r835knYXJoYhoXxQN8dnzRRMBoN\nwABkVw9fLEzKpFqlgQei3TxhrvMCTSNpinN1saQEVdzfDyLppwxzTSdThFga2mhe\n+yQxt9pRObgCUccj1UawBwbAJXy2PfoTjO1ZIVnPMYZdRuJjielzmf8bwPm+uZPa\nIvcGXX3u4UgXUfhmCADb\n=SHQc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-22T18:09:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":""