.com/meo-mumu","id":140348946,"login":"meo-mumu","node_id":"U_kgDOCF2OEg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meo-mumu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meo-mumu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meo-mumu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meo-mumu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meo-mumu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/meo-mumu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/meo-mumu/meo-mumu-io/commits/1473d10fb31c154a18618f8ad034ff4824053ed0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-24T14:14:28Z","email":"meo.sound@hotmail.com","name":"meo-mumu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-24T14:14:28Z","email":"meo.sound@hotmail.com","name":"meo-mumu"},"message":"✨ Refactor: Migration vers architecture Clean Code moderne\n\n- Architecture modulaire avec séparation claire des responsabilités\n- Système particles splitté en 8 modules spécialisés (config, physics, renderer, etc.)\n- Structure UI flat avec noms explicites (bullet-colorizer.js, animation-cv.js)\n- Suppression de utils.js - fonctions intégrées dans bullet-colorizer.js\n- Migration /ancien vers structure moderne /public, /server, /src\n- Serveur Express avec routes et middleware organisés\n- Tous les composants fonctionnels migrés et testés\n\n🚀 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"22b030174288acd32be4e598b71c1683477e9dfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/meo-mumu/meo-mumu-io/git/trees/22b030174288acd32be4e598b71c1683477e9dfb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/meo-mumu/meo-mumu-io/git/commits/1473d10fb31c154a18618f8ad034ff4824053ed0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140348946?v